  message), \code{NA} when it was fitted. \code{groups[groups$group == name, ]} is one group;
  \code{groups[!is.na(groups$error_kind), ]} the groups mzLib refused.

  \code{kind} is the kind applied, yours or mzLib's default; \code{minimum_anchors} (anchors), \code{bandwidth}
